  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overseas Development Institute Partnership - HPG Integrated Program 2020-22</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Humanitarian Policy Group of the Overseas Development Institute (ODI) provides independent analysis of humanitarian issues that contributes to the development of the Australian aid program&apos;s humanitarian policy and practice. This contribution to the Humanitarian Policy Group will assists strategic thinking on humanitarian issues. It will also support: analysing the developmental and humanitarian benefits of investment in disaster mitigation, risk reduction and preparedness activities and promoting findings within the region; and maintaining a core area in DFAT, specialising in humanitarian action, to provide policy and operational advice on current best practices. The total value of this initiative is $900,000 ($300,000 per financial year), starting in the 2019-20 financial year.</narrative>
  </description>
